// Grids/marquee use small 640px thumbnails (see toThumb) so the page never
// decodes the full 2880px originals in bulk; the lightbox loads the full path.
// Every item carries [w, h] so masonry cards get a real aspect-ratio before the
// image loads (no zero-height, reliable scroll-reveal, no layout shift).

